==German==

===Etymology===
15th century as {{m|de||sparge(n), sparges}}, from {{der|de|ML.|sparagus}}, {{m|la|asparagus}}, in part through {{bor|de|it|sparago}}, {{m|it|sparagio}}. The form in {{m|de|-el}} (16th c.) probably after such plant names as {{m|de|Kerbel}}, {{m|de|Kümmel}}.

